# Project-level agent skills. They encode conventions of THIS codebase, so they
# are deliberately local: the universal delivery rules live in the global
# OpenCode config, and these are the CyberVault-specific companion. Keeping them
# out of version control means a fresh clone does not inherit a set of local
# conventions that may have drifted from the code it ships with.
.opencode/skills/

